CC0 1.0 Universal

Statement of Purpose

The laws of most jurisdictions throughout the world automatically confer
exclusive Copyright and Related or Neighboring Rights upon authorship of
works.

The author (or individual authorized to act on the author's behalf) of a
work given under CC0 provides the following statement of purpose to that
work:

To the extent the author of a work has copyright or related or neighboring
rights over the work, they waive all copyright and related or neighboring
rights to the work worldwide under CC0, to the extent possible under law.

For more information, see:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/